§ T24.a lsp/ workspace
  lines : 2 files (workspace + server Cargo.toml)
  deps : tokio + tower-lsp 0.20 + serde + serde_json + rusqlite + dashmap
         blake3 + tracing + anyhow + thiserror + levenshtein + regex + url +
         tempfile
  lto : release-profile lto="fat" + codegen-units=1 (workspace-root)

§ T24.b server.rs (220 LOC) + main.rs (90 LOC)
  main.rs : tokio-runtime + CLI flag parsing + stdio/TCP transport dispatch
  server.rs : Backend struct w/ Client + RwLock<Config> + DashMap<Url, Document>
              + ParserShim + Arc<WorkspaceIndex>
              + async-trait LanguageServer impl (17 methods)
              + debounce-spawned re-diagnostics on didChange

§ T24.c parser_shim.rs (200 LOC)
  cache : BLAKE3(uri | text) hex key ; 4 DashMap caches
          (cssllint, IR, SMT, typecheck)
  methods : cssllint + typecheck + ir + smt + opt_stats + format
  transport : tempfile (parser.exe takes file-path args, not stdin)
  timeout : 5-30s per-method ; tokio::time::timeout + spawn_blocking
  graceful-degrade : non-zero exit returns anyhow error ; server
                     continues ; missing parser.exe → empty diagnostic-list

§ T24.d diagnostics.rs (150 LOC)
  map_cssllint_entry : line/col 1-based → 0-based for LSP
  map_severity : sev-field-first, code-prefix-fallback
                  (PERMISSIVE → Hint, CSL-E → Error, CSL-W → Warning, CSL-I → Info)
  diagnostics_from_smt : one Error per failing obligation +
                         related_information w/ counter-example location
  merge : dedup by (line, col, code, msg) preserving first-occurrence

§ T24.e hover.rs (260 LOC)
  glyph_info : 50+ high-value glyphs (§ → ← ↔ ≤ ≥ ≠ ∧ ∨ ¬ ∀ ∃ ∈ ⊆ ⊂ ∪ ∩
               ⇒ ∵ ∴ ⊗ ⊕ ✓ ◐ ○ ✗ ⊘ △ ▽ ‼ ⟨⟩ ⌈⌉ ⟦⟧ «» ⟪⟫ ∫ ⊞ ⊑ ⊔ ⊓
               λ π μ ν + Greek letters)
  morpheme_info : 9 morphemes with refinement-formula + slot + docs-ref
  type_for_ident : consults typecheck JSON globals map (extension TODO)
  word_around : identifier-or-apostrophe extraction around cursor

§ T24.f completion.rs (230 LOC)
  morpheme_completions : 9-tag list w/ markdown-doc tooltip
  section_completions : 6 modal + 5 think-block headers
  compound_completions_dot : 20 morpheme + aspect/modality options
  compound_completions_having / at / and
  type_completions : primitive types (i8..i64, u8..u64, f32/f64, vecN, etc.)
  default_completions : keywords + snippets (fn/def/enum/record)
  trigger-char dispatch + char_before_cursor fallback

§ T24.g workspace_index.rs (110 LOC) + goto.rs (220 LOC)
  WorkspaceIndex : DashMap<String, Vec<Symbol>> in-memory
                   find_definition + find_references + workspace_symbols
                   (Levenshtein-2 fuzzy on short queries)
  goto.rs : definition_at via IR-walk for cslv3.fn name-attr match
            references_at via IR-recursive-walk + WorkspaceIndex merge
            document_symbols from IR top-level ops
  SQLite persistence : deferred to Session-10+

§ T24.g formatting.rs (40 LOC) + code_actions.rs (100 LOC) + semantic_tokens.rs (150 LOC)
  formatting : full-doc via parser --print --mode=canonical
               range-format falls through to whole-doc (v1 scope)
  code_actions :
    CSL-W-003 morph-unknown → suggest-nearest via Levenshtein against 9 tags
    CSL-W-007 PERMISSIVE → "toggle --strict-parse" source-action
    CSL-E-200 type-mismatch → review-hint quick-fix
  semantic_tokens : 5 types (keyword/operator/comment/string/number/macro)
                    per-character walk w/ LSP delta-encoding

§ T24.h smt_diag.rs (50 LOC) + opt_diag.rs (45 LOC)
  smt_diag : code-lens per cslv3.fn for "discharge SMT obligations"
             + optional "opt -O<level>" lens when configured
  opt_diag : one Information diagnostic per opt-pass with applied>0

