§ ARCHITECTURE-NOTES-APPLIED
  tower-lsp 0.20                      ← maturity + ecosystem + tokio-native
  parser.exe subprocess               ← single-source-of-truth ; dual-
                                        maintenance avoided ; cache-on-URI-hash
  BLAKE3 in-memory cache              ← 5x faster than SHA256 for keystroke-
                                        scale invalidation
  Full-reparse + 200ms debounce       ← parser-perf headroom ; incremental-AST
                                        deferred until profiling-shows-need
  sev-field-first severity            ← parser.exe centralizes severity-table
  static glyph-hover table            ← ~1ms lookup vs ~80ms subprocess
  hand-rolled semantic-tokens         ← precise 74-glyph coverage beyond-TM
  in-memory WorkspaceIndex            ← SQLite-persistence deferred
  minimal TypeScript extension        ← ~120 LOC ; auto-discovers server
  vscodeignore for VSIX packaging     ← excludes src/ + *.ts + *.map
  clippy -D warnings                  ← zero-tolerance lint policy
  cargo test full-stdio-dance         ← exercises protocol + asserts caps

